\section*{Conclusion}
The transfer and output characteristics of the NMOS transistor were successfully plotted using Cadence Virtuoso. Important device parameters such as $V_{th}$, $g_m$, $r_o$, and $\lambda$ were extracted and analyzed. The results align with the expected behavior of a 90nm NMOS device.

